# Essence Channeler: "When this creature dies, put its counters on target creature you control" - every kind of counter it had as
# it died, not only +1/+1 counters, put on (not moved), by its last existence on the battlefield (CR 603.10a, 608.2h; rulings
# 2024-07-26). Bot1's Swords to Plowshares on its own Llanowar Elves gains Bot1 1 life, and the Channeler gets a +1/+1 counter
# (3/2). Bot2's Lodestone Needle taps it and puts two stun counters on it, and Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills it. The trigger can't
# target Bot2's Llanowar Elves (refused: "you control") and targets one of Bot1's two Ornithopters, which gets one +1/+1 counter
# and two stun counters: a 1/3. The other Ornithopter gets nothing.

